{"document":{"type":"root","children":[{"type":"code","value":"function deleteByKey(objectStore, key): Promise<void>;","lang":"ts"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Defined in: packages/db/src/indexed-db-wrapper.ts:456"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Deletes an item by its key from an object store."}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"parameters","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Parameters"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"objectstore","children":[{"type":"text","value":"objectStore"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"IDBObjectStore"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"The IDBObjectStore to delete from"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"key","children":[{"type":"text","value":"key"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"IDBValidKey"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"The key of the item to delete"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"returns","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Returns"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"Promise"},{"type":"text","value":"<"},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"void"},{"type":"text","value":">"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"A promise that resolves when the item is deleted"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"example","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Example"}]},{"type":"code","value":"await executeTransaction(db, 'todos', 'readwrite', async (tx, stores) => {\n  await deleteByKey(stores.todos, 1)\n  console.log('Todo deleted')\n})","lang":"typescript"}],"headings":[{"id":"parameters","text":"Parameters","level":2},{"id":"objectstore","text":"objectStore","level":3},{"id":"key","text":"key","level":3},{"id":"returns","text":"Returns","level":2},{"id":"example","text":"Example","level":2}]},"frameworks":[],"downloadMarkdown":"\n```ts\nfunction deleteByKey(objectStore, key): Promise<void>;\n```\n\nDefined in: packages/db/src/indexed-db-wrapper.ts:456\n\nDeletes an item by its key from an object store.\n\n## Parameters\n\n### objectStore\n\n`IDBObjectStore`\n\nThe IDBObjectStore to delete from\n\n### key\n\n`IDBValidKey`\n\nThe key of the item to delete\n\n## Returns\n\n`Promise`\\<`void`\\>\n\nA promise that resolves when the item is deleted\n\n## Example\n\n```typescript\nawait executeTransaction(db, 'todos', 'readwrite', async (tx, stores) => {\n  await deleteByKey(stores.todos, 1)\n  console.log('Todo deleted')\n})\n```\n","originalRawMarkdown":"---\nid: deleteByKey\ntitle: deleteByKey\n---\n\n```ts\nfunction deleteByKey(objectStore, key): Promise<void>;\n```\n\nDefined in: packages/db/src/indexed-db-wrapper.ts:456\n\nDeletes an item by its key from an object store.\n\n## Parameters\n\n### objectStore\n\n`IDBObjectStore`\n\nThe IDBObjectStore to delete from\n\n### key\n\n`IDBValidKey`\n\nThe key of the item to delete\n\n## Returns\n\n`Promise`\\<`void`\\>\n\nA promise that resolves when the item is deleted\n\n## Example\n\n```typescript\nawait executeTransaction(db, 'todos', 'readwrite', async (tx, stores) => {\n  await deleteByKey(stores.todos, 1)\n  console.log('Todo deleted')\n})\n```\n"}
